---
import "@styles/markdown-layout.css";
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  breadcrumbs={[
    {
      label: "Home",
      href: "/",
    },
    {
      label: "About",
    },
  ]}
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <h2>Developer</h2>
  <p>
    Hi, I'm <b class="text-primary">Remagi</b>, the developer of Reverse: 1999
    Gnomon.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Reverse: 1999 Gnomon was created for viewing information about the game
    <a href="https://re1999.bluepoch.com/" target="_blank" class="custom-link"
      >Reverse: 1999</a
    >, a game created by Bluepoch.
  </p>
  <p>
    This website is not intended to replace wiki; instead, it will be more
    focused on gameplay information.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Please use
    <a
      href="https://bsky.app/profile/xremagix.bsky.social"
      target="_blank"
      class="custom-link"
    >
      Bluesky
    </a>
    or
    <a
      href="https://discordapp.com/users/1161314161842720798"
      target="_blank"
      class="custom-link"
    >
      Discord
    </a>
    to contact me with any questions or issues regarding the website.
  </p>

  <h2>Acknowledgments</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/myssal/Reverse-1999-CN-Asset"
        target="_blank"
        class="custom-link"
      >
        Reverse 1999 Huijiwiki
      </a>
      : For the inspiration and information used in the website.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/myssal/Reverse-1999-CN-Asset"
        target="_blank"
        class="custom-link"
      >
        Reverse-1999-CN-Asset
      </a>
      : For the assets used in the website.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://sites.google.com/view/vinglersmirror/home?authuser=0"
        target="_blank"
        class="custom-link"
      >
        Vingler's Mirror
      </a>
      and
      <a
        href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1lUzkJvRfV2diLiU0ai6mCrM-kkm0cqwblo1VvCkhYi4/edit?gid=1734357303#gid=1734357303"
        target="_blank"
        class="custom-link"
      >
        Resonance Community Guide
      </a>
      : For resonance guide.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.kdocs.cn/l/cd5MWeCl5bKw"
        target="_blank"
        class="custom-link"
      >
        CN Community Material Guide
      </a>
      : For material cheatsheet.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Game Content Attribution</h2>
  <p>
    All artwork and assets related to the game are owned by Bluepoch. Reverse:
    1999 Gnomon is a fan-made project that is not officially affiliated with or
    endorsed by Bluepoch. As such, all rights to the game and its associated
    content remain with Bluepoch.
  </p>
</Layout>
